{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared schema contract for the SQLite database, generated from the Android",
    "Room export (android/app/schemas/.../<schemaVersion>.json), which is",
    "authoritative.",
    "Android asserts that its exported schema still matches this file; iOS asserts",
    "that the database GRDB creates matches it, by introspecting PRAGMA table_info,",
    "index_list and foreign_key_list. Neither platform can drift.",
    "Room's own bookkeeping (room_master_table, user_version) is NOT part of the",
    "contract: a database FILE is not an interchange format between the platforms.",
    "The JSON backup is. What is shared is the table shape, so the domain logic and",
    "the queries mean the same thing on both sides.",
    "Column order follows the Room export and is significant only for readability.",
    "entries.utcOffsetSeconds is nullable on purpose: NULL means the entry predates the column and its clock time is read through the device zone's historical rules. It is appended last so a freshly created table and one reached by ALTER TABLE carry the same column order."
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 3,
  "tables": [
    {
      "name": "drinks",
      "columns": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "type": "INTEGER",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
          "name": "name",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
          "name": "volumeMl",
          "type": "INTEGER",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
          "name": "alcoholPercent",
          "type": "REAL",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
          "name": "isPreset",
          "type": "INTEGER",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
          "name": "isFavorite",
          "type": "INTEGER",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
          "name": "category",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "notNull": true
        }
      ],
      "primaryKey": [
        "id"
      ],
      "autoIncrement": true,
      "indices": [],
      "foreignKeys": []
    },
    {
      "name": "entries",
      "columns": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "type": "INTEGER",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
          "name": "drinkId",
          "type": "INTEGER",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
          "name": "drinkName",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "notNull": true
        },
        {
